help[6]:
  Run `superdesign list-design-systems` to inspect existing design systems & projects
  Run `superdesign search-prompts --query "<style or component>"` to find style / inspiration references
  Run `superdesign create-project --title "<title>"` to start a new design project
  Run `superdesign iterate-design-draft --draft-id <id> -p "<direction>" --mode <replace|branch>` to refine the selected draft (replace) or explore alternatives (branch)
  Run `superdesign generate-image --project-id <id> --prompt "<what>"` to quote an image/video generation (free; confirm-generation spends credits after user approval)
  Run `superdesign <command> --help` for full options on any command
SuperDesign collects anonymous CLI usage; set DO_NOT_TRACK=1 to disable
